01:14:49.700 --> 01:14:51.700
in parallel. Okay.

01:14:51.700 --> 01:14:56.700
And this strategy of just trying a small change and seeing whether it leads

01:14:56.700 --> 01:14:59.700
to an increase or decrease, and then taking a larger step in that direction,

01:14:59.700 --> 01:15:05.700
which is sort of assume you're blind and you're in a dark room and you have to

01:15:05.700 --> 01:15:09.700
