So you put one foot and you put one foot and you realize, okay, this is higher

01:15:15.700 --> 01:15:18.700
ground and you put one another foot and you realize, okay, that is lower ground.

01:15:18.700 --> 01:15:23.700
If you want to go downhill, then you step, take a couple of steps, maybe along

01:15:23.700 --> 01:15:25.700
