It works in exactly the same way.

01:29:15.700 --> 01:29:17.700
This is the one of the nice things about scikit-learn.

01:29:17.700 --> 01:29:20.700
If you know how to use one model, you know how to use all the models.

01:29:20.700 --> 01:29:24.700
It's just that internally what's happening is different.

01:29:24.700 --> 01:29:35.700
So try out the SGD regressor and train a model, make some predictions, compute the laws and see if you see any difference in the result.

