We take a linear combination or a weighted sum of the input features.

02:32:20.700 --> 02:32:29.700
So let's say if we just look at today's temperature and today's rainfall, and we want to use those to predict whether it will rain tomorrow or not.

02:32:29.700 --> 02:32:32.700
So we start out by taking a linear combination.

02:32:32.700 --> 02:32:36.700
Let's say we pick a weight W1, a random weight W1.

