03:11:40.700 --> 03:11:44.700
And that's going to give me a training data frame and a validation data frame.

03:11:44.700 --> 03:11:48.700
So first we extracted a test data frame, then we extracted a validation data frame.

03:11:48.700 --> 03:11:50.700
And finally we were left with the training data frame.

03:11:50.700 --> 03:11:54.700
So this is how we have created three data frames and you can check their sizes.

03:11:54.700 --> 03:11:59.700
Training data frame now contains 84,500 data points.

