03:54:11.500 --> 03:54:15.180
is a common technique for solving binary classification problems.

03:54:15.180 --> 03:54:18.540
We take a linear combination or a weighted sum of the input features.

03:54:18.540 --> 03:54:21.020
That's why we need them all to be numeric.

03:54:21.020 --> 03:54:24.260
